              "type": "text",
              "text": "Customers ask support for their gift card balance about 40 times a week. Add a balance check to the Gift cards page so they can look it up themselves. Balances come from the GiftCo API (GET /v2/cards/{number})."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
